badge\\n\\nVisitors return badges at the front desk on their way out. Wipe the badge with\\nthe cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer and put it back in the return tray. Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\\n\\n## If a badge is not returned\\n\\nMark the visitor's line on the expected-visitor list with an N. At the end of\\nthe day, send the list of unreturned badges to the security office. Badges that\\nhave been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\\n\\n## Lost badges found later\\n\\nA badge handed in after it was reported missing goes to the security office\\nrather than back into the return tray. The security office decides whether to\\nreactivate it.\\n\\n## Contractors\\n\\nContractors on a job lasting more than one day are issued a week badge instead\\nof a day badge. A week badge is valid for 7 days from the date printed on it. Contractors sign the contractor register in addition to the visitor list.\",\"decisions\":[{\"slot\":\"title\",\"candidates\":[{\"text\":\"# Badge Access - Front Desk Procedure\",\"document\":\"source_a.md\"},{\"text\":\"# Visitor Badge Handling\",\"document\":\"source_b.md\"}],\"chosen\":\"# Badge Access - Front Desk Procedure\",\"reason\":\"Base document's title; it also covers the contractor section.\"},{\"slot\":\"placement of Lost badges found later section\",\"candidates\":[{\"text\":\"After If a badge is not returned\",\"document\":\"source_b.md\"},{\"text\":\"After Contractors (end of base order)\",\"document\":\"source_a.md\"}],\"chosen\":\"After If a badge is not returned\",\"reason\":\"It continues the unreturned-badge topic, so it follows that section.\"}],\"dispositions\":[{\"segment\":\"b1\",\"disposition\":\"superseded\",\"replacement\":\"# Badge Access - Front Desk Procedure\",\"reason\":\"Base title kept; this title not taken.\"},{\"segment\":\"b2\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"## Issuing a visitor badge\",\"reason\":\"Same heading as a2.\"},{\"segment\":\"b3\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"Ask the visitor for photo identification and check the name against the day's\\nexpected-visitor list.\",\"reason\":\"Identical to a3.\"},{\"segment\":\"b4\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"Print a badge from the front desk terminal.\",\"reason\":\"Identical to a4.\"},{\"segment\":\"b5\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"Write the\\nhost's name on the badge in the space provided.\",\"reason\":\"Identical to a5.\"},{\"segment\":\"b6\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"Hand the badge over and ask the\\nvisitor to wear it above the waist and in view for the whole visit.\",\"reason\":\"Identical to a6.\"},{\"segment\":\"b7\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"## Returning a badge\",\"reason\":\"Same heading as a7.\"},{\"segment\":\"b8\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"Visitors return badges at the front desk on their way out.\",\"reason\":\"Identical to a8.\"},{\"segment\":\"b9\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"Wipe the badge with\\nthe cleaning cloth kept in the top drawer and put it back in the return tray.\",\"reason\":\"Identical to a9.\"},{\"segment\":\"b10\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"Badges in the return tray are re-used the same day.\",\"reason\":\"Identical to a10.\"},{\"segment\":\"b11\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"## If a badge is not returned\",\"reason\":\"Same heading as a11.\"},{\"segment\":\"b12\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"Mark the visitor's line on the expected-visitor list with an N. At the end of\\nthe day, send the list of unreturned badges to the security office.\",\"reason\":\"Identical to a12.\"},{\"segment\":\"b13\",\"disposition\":\"duplicate\",\"replacement\":\"Badges that\\nhave been missing for 7 days are deactivated.\",\"reason\":\"Identical to a13.\"}],\"mismatch\":\"\"}\n```","ttft_ms":13105,"type":"result","duration_ms":22954,"uuid":"0979abe5-0c23-4b97-9af7-4971a4